      <rules>
        <rule name="Ally of the Silent Order" id="f1c6-edd2-409c-cfe5" hidden="false">
          <description>A Detachment that includes Tsolmon Khan may include a single Knight Centura as a non-Compulsory HQ choice without taking up a Force Organisation slot (see  Liber Imperium). A Raptora Cadre may be taken as a Retinue for a Knight Centura included in this way (see Liber Imperium). Sisters of Silence included in an army with Tsolmon Khan are treated as Sworn Brothers.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
